   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "gardening.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Shade is tricky but doable. Do you want flowers there, or something low-maintenance like ferns and ground cover?",
